{"segs": ["PA_ja_369:0.1", "PA_ja_369:0.2"], "en": "The Jātaka: The Fifth Book of Birth Stories,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_369:0.3"], "en": "Chapter on the Arising of Color (Vaṇṇārohavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_369:0.4", "PA_ja_369:1.1"], "en": "9. The Mittavindakajātaka “What have I done against the gods?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_369:1.2"], "en": "What evil deed have I committed?”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_369:1.3"], "en": "“Having struck my head,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_369:1.4"], "en": "this wheel revolves upon my crown.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_369:2.1"], "en": "“Having passed beyond Ramaṇaka, [he went to]...”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_369:2.2"], "en": "And Sadāmatta and Dūbhaka,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_369:2.3"], "en": "and the Brahmattara palace—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_369:2.4"], "en": "by what purpose has he come here?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_369:3.1"], "en": "“‘There will be more wealth here;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_369:3.2"], "en": "I think it will be so,’—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_369:3.3"], "en": "with such a perception as this, [one acts].”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_369:3.4"], "en": "“Behold me fallen into calamity!", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_369:4.1"], "en": "“From four he attained eight,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_369:4.2"], "en": "and from eight, sixteen.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_369:4.3"], "en": "And sixteen and thirty-two,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_369:4.4", "PA_ja_369:4.5"], "en": "the wheel has come upon him who desires excessively; for the person struck down by desire, [the wheel of suffering turns].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_369:4.6"], "en": "The wheel turns upon my head.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_369:5.1"], "en": "Vast above, difficult to fill,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_369:5.2"], "en": "desire spreads far and wide.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_369:5.3", "PA_ja_369:5.4"], "en": "\"And those who greedily pursue it become bearers of the wheel.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_369:6.1"], "en": "The *Mittavindaka Jātaka*, the ninth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
]
